From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 10:04:57 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Email the owner on every successful login (password or
 Google)

New app/notifications/login_alert.py: after each successful sign-in, a
FastAPI background task emails name, email, role, method, SAST time, IP
and device to LOGIN_ALERT_EMAIL (comma-separated), falling back to
SMTP_USER then ADMIN_EMAIL. Independent of NOTIFY_EMAILS; never blocks or
breaks login if SMTP fails. LOGIN_ALERTS_ENABLED=false turns it off.
Google sign-ins flag first-time (new account) logins.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
